flowchart TD
    Start([CLI 已解析 Install 参数]) --> Acquire[Acquire 全局 APM 锁]
    Acquire --> Recover[TransactionManager.Recover]
    Recover -->|失败| FatalRelease[尝试 Release；返回零结果]
    Recover -->|成功| RecoveryLog{Recovered?}
    RecoveryLog -->|是| Warn[锁内同步 slog.Warn transaction recovered]
    RecoveryLog -->|否| Debug[锁内 Install 专属 Debug]
    Warn --> Refresh[AdapterRegistry.RefreshInstalled]
    Debug --> Refresh
    Refresh -->|失败| FatalRelease
    Refresh --> Validate{具体 Agent 在快照中，或 all 非空?}
    Validate -->|否| FatalRelease
    Validate -->|是| CloudList[CloudClient.List]
    CloudList -->|失败| FatalRelease
    CloudList --> ExactName[按区分大小写的 Name 精确收集候选]
    ExactName -->|无候选| FatalRelease
    ExactName --> TypeAmbiguous{省略 Type 且跨 Type 同名?}
    TypeAmbiguous -->|是| FatalRelease
    TypeAmbiguous -->|否| Version[在确定 Type 后选择显式版本或最大 SemVer]
    Version -->|失败| FatalRelease
    Version --> NextAgent{按快照顺序还有目标 Agent?}

    NextAgent -->|否且无业务失败| ReleaseSuccess[Release]
    NextAgent -->|是| Resolve[Resolve 当前 Agent/Type Adapter]
    Resolve -->|失败| FailFast[追加当前 failed；剩余按顺序追加 unexecuted]
    Resolve -->|成功| Find[ConfigRepository.Find 当前 Type/Name]
    Find -->|失败| FailFast
    Find --> Same{Previous.Version 等于目标版本?}
    Same -->|是| Unchanged[追加 unchanged；不检查 target、不 Fetch、不调用 Transaction]
    Unchanged --> NextAgent
    Same -->|否| Fetch[Cache.Fetch 当前 Agent 的公共 staging root]
    Fetch -->|命中| TxInstall[TransactionManager.Install]
    Fetch -->|ErrMiss| Get[Cloud.Get 精确 PowerRef]
    Fetch -->|其他错误| FailFast
    Get -->|失败| FailFast
    Get -->|成功| ReFetch[再次 Cache.Fetch]
    ReFetch -->|失败| FailFast
    ReFetch -->|成功| TxInstall

    subgraph Transaction[Install Transaction：不打印业务输出]
        TxInstall --> TargetState{Previous 非空且 target 缺失?}
        TargetState -->|是| Remove[ManifestWriter.Remove(agent,type,name)]
        Remove --> CleanStaging[安全清理 canonical staging]
        CleanStaging --> StaleAbort[返回 ErrStaleManifest；不生成 ID、不创建 journal、不调用 Adapter、不安装]
        StaleAbort --> FailFast
        TargetState -->|否| TargetConflict{Previous 为空且 target 存在?}
        TargetConflict -->|是| TxError[返回清单外冲突]
        TxError --> FailFast
        TargetConflict -->|否| Journal[生成 ID，创建 preparing journal]
        Journal --> Publish[持久化 publishing；Adapter 安装/原子发布]
        Publish --> Commit[持久化 committing；Set 清单；清理；删除 journal]
        Commit -->|失败| TxError
        Commit -->|成功| TxOK[返回事务成功]
    end
    TxOK --> Outcome{Previous 存在?}
    Outcome -->|否| Installed[追加 installed]
    Outcome -->|是且目标更高| Upgraded[追加 upgraded]
    Outcome -->|是且目标更低| Downgraded[追加 downgraded]
    Installed --> NextAgent
    Upgraded --> NextAgent
    Downgraded --> NextAgent

    FailFast --> ReleaseBatch[Release]
    ReleaseBatch -->|成功| BatchResult[返回完整结果 + InstallBatchError]
    ReleaseBatch -->|失败| Suppress[返回零结果和 joined error；抑制结果]
    ReleaseSuccess -->|成功| SuccessResult[返回完整成功结果]
    ReleaseSuccess -->|失败| Suppress
    FatalRelease -->|Release 成功或失败| Fatal[返回零结果；无业务行]
    BatchResult --> RenderBatch[CLI renderer 写每个 outcome 行，然后统一 Error/usage、非零]
    SuccessResult --> RenderSuccess[CLI renderer 写每个 outcome 行，正常退出]
    Suppress --> ErrorOnly[CLI 统一 Error/usage；不渲染 stdout]
    Fatal --> ErrorOnly
